    .desc = Remains left by ritual Yautja butchery.

ent-CMUYautjaXenoButcheredRemains = butchered xeno remains
    .desc = Acid-stained remains left by ritual Yautja butchery.

ent-CMUYautjaTrophyBelt = trophy belt
    .desc = A ceremonial Yautja belt for displaying claimed trophies and ritual victories.

ent-CMUYautjaPolishingRag = polishing rag
    .desc = An astonishingly fine, hand-tailored piece of exotic cloth.

ent-CMUYautjaHuntingTrap = hunting trap
    .desc = A bizarre Yautja device used for trapping and killing prey.

ent-CMUYautjaHarpoon = large harpoon
    .desc = A huge metal spike with a hook at the end. It's carved with mysterious alien writing.

ent-CMUYautjaChainwhip = chainwhip
    .desc = A segmented, lightweight whip made of durable, acid-resistant metal. Not very common among Yautja Hunters, but still a dangerous weapon capable of shredding prey.

ent-CMUYautjaClanSword = clan sword
    .desc = An expertly crafted Yautja blade carried by hunters who wish to fight up close. Razor sharp and capable of cutting flesh into ribbons. Commonly carried by aggressive and lethal hunters.

ent-CMUYautjaRendingSword = rending sword
    .desc = An expertly crafted Yautja blade carried by hunters who wish to fight up close. Razor sharp and capable of cutting flesh into ribbons. Commonly carried by aggressive and lethal hunters.

ent-CMUYautjaPiercingSword = piercing sword
    .desc = An expertly crafted Yautja blade carried by hunters who wish to fight up close. Razor sharp and capable of cutting flesh into ribbons. Commonly carried by aggressive and lethal hunters.

ent-CMUYautjaSeveringSword = severing sword
    .desc = An expertly crafted Yautja blade carried by hunters who wish to fight up close. Razor sharp and capable of cutting flesh into ribbons. Commonly carried by aggressive and lethal hunters.

ent-CMUYautjaDualWarScythe = dual war scythe
    .desc = A huge, incredibly sharp dual blade used for hunting dangerous prey. This weapon is commonly carried by Yautja who wish to disable and slice apart their foes.

ent-CMUYautjaDoubleWarScythe = double war scythe
    .desc = A huge, incredibly sharp double blade used for hunting dangerous prey. This weapon is commonly carried by Yautja who wish to disable and slice apart their foes.

ent-CMUYautjaCruelStaff = cruel staff
    .desc = A wicked and battered staff wrapped in worn crimson rags. A crescent shaped blade adorns the top, while the bottom is rounded and blunt.

ent-CMUYautjaCombistick = combi-stick
    .desc = A compact yet deadly personal weapon. Can be concealed when folded. Functions well as a throwing weapon or defensive tool. A common sight in Yautja packs due to its versatility.

ent-CMUYautjaWarAxe = war axe
    .desc = A swift weapon designed to gouge and gore the hunter's prey. A chain is attached to the hilt, allowing for a quick retrieval.

ent-CMUYautjaCeremonialDagger = ceremonial dagger
    .desc = A viciously sharp dagger inscribed with ancient Yautja markings. Smells thickly of blood. Carried by some hunters.

ent-CMUYautjaClanShield = clan shield
    .desc = A large tribal shield made of a strange metal alloy. The face of the shield bears three skulls, two human, one alien.

ent-CMUYautjaAncientShield = ancient shield
    .desc = A large, ancient shield forged from an unknown golden alloy, gleaming with a luminous brilliance. Its worn surface and masterful craftsmanship hint at a forgotten purpose and a history lost to time.

ent-CMUYautjaAncientShieldAlt = ancient shield
    .desc = A large, ornately crafted shield forged from an unknown alloy. The colossal metal skull of a Xenomorph dominates the center, its jagged edges and hollow eyes giving it a fearsome presence. The masterful craftsmanship and weathered battle scars whisper of long-forgotten hunts and a legacy etched in blood.

ent-CMUYautjaAncientShieldTemple = ancient shield
    .desc = A large, ancient shield forged from an unknown alloy. Its time-worn surface and masterful craftsmanship hint at a forgotten purpose and a history lost to time.

ent-CMUYautjaHunterSpear = hunter spear
    .desc = A spear of exquisite design, used by an ancient civilisation.

ent-CMUYautjaWarGlaive = war glaive
    .desc = Two huge, powerful blades on a metallic pole. Mysterious writing is carved into the weapon.

ent-CMUYautjaCleavingGlaive = cleaving glaive
    .desc = A huge, powerful blade on a metallic pole. Mysterious writing is carved into the weapon.

ent-CMUYautjaAncientWarGlaive = ancient war glaive
    .desc = A huge, powerful blade on a metallic pole. Mysterious writing is carved into the weapon. This one is ancient and has suffered serious acid damage, making it near-useless.

ent-CMUYautjaLongaxe = longaxe
    .desc = A frighteningly big axe. The blade edge is chipped and gnarled from thousands of bone-crushing blows.

ent-CMUYautjaDuellingBlade = duelling blade
    .desc = A primitive yet deadly sword used in yautja rituals and duels. Though crude compared to their advanced weaponry, its sharp edge demands respect.

ent-CMUYautjaDuellingClub = duelling club
    .desc = A crude metal club adorned with a skull. Used as a non-lethal training weapon for young yautja honing their combat skills.

ent-CMUYautjaDuellingHatchet = duelling hatchet
    .desc = A short ceremonial duelling hatchet. Designed for ritual combat or settling disputes among Yautja. It features a keen edge capable of cleaving flesh or bone. Though smaller than traditional Yautja weapons.

ent-CMUYautjaDuellingKnife = duelling knife
    .desc = A length of leather-bound wood studded with razor-sharp teeth. How crude.

ent-CMUYautjaSpikeProjectile = alloy spike

ent-CMUYautjaSpikeLauncher = spike launcher
    .desc = A compact Yautja device in the shape of a crescent. It can rapidly fire damaging spikes and automatically recharges.

ent-CMUYautjaPlasmaRifle = plasma rifle
    .desc = A long-barreled heavy plasma weapon. Intended for combat, not hunting. Has an integrated battery that allows for a functionally unlimited amount of shots to be discharged. Equipped with an internal gyroscopic stabilizer allowing its operator to fire the weapon one-handed if desired.

ent-CMUYautjaPlasmaCarbine = plasma carbine
    .desc = A short-barreled rapid-fire assault weapon only given to military caste soldiers, unsuitable for hunting actual prey. Features a deadly burst-fire mode, alongside incendiary or impact-explosive rounds. Although more accurate when wielded, it can be fired with one hand.

ent-CMUYautjaHeavyGelDefoliator = heavy gel defoliator
    .desc = A high-power incendiary device used to rapidly expunge evidence of hives or dishonorable foes. Unsurprisingly, it is just as effective in direct combat, and lightweight enough to be fired with one hand.

ent-CMUYautjaDefoliatorFuelTank = gel defoliator fuel tank
    .desc = A high-capacity heat-resistant tank of highly-flammable gel fuel for a heavy defoliator.

ent-CMUYautjaDefoliatorFuelTankDeathsquad = gel defoliator fuel tank (EX)
    .desc = A high-capacity heat-resistant tank of terrifyingly powerful gelled plasma, capable of burning right through almost anything. Handle with extreme caution.

ent-CMUYautjaPlasmaPistol = plasma pistol
    .desc = A plasma pistol capable of rapid fire. It has an integrated battery. Can be used to set fires, either to braziers or on people.

ent-CMUYautjaHuntingBow = hunting bow
    .desc = An abnormal-sized weapon with an exceptionally tight string. Requires extraordinary strength to draw.

ent-CMUYautjaArrowBase = inert arrow
    .desc = A heavy arrow made of a strange metal. Used by alien hunters with powerful bows.

ent-CMUYautjaExplosiveArrowActive = activated explosive arrow

ent-CMUYautjaEmpArrowActive = activated emp arrow

ent-CMUYautjaDynamicArrow = inert dynamic arrow

ent-CMUYautjaSnareArrow = snare arrow
    .desc = A bow launched snare.

ent-CMUYautjaQuiverStrap = quiver strap
    .desc = A strap that can hold a bow with a quiver for arrows.

ent-CMUYautjaArrowProjectile = arrow

ent-CMUYautjaExplosiveArrowProjectile = explosive arrow

ent-CMUYautjaEmpArrowProjectile = EMP arrow

ent-CMUYautjaSnareArrowProjectile = snare arrow

